    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 234]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(School Vacations)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "We have two main school vacations:"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "one is in the summer, and one in the winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "During vacation time, we don’t go to public school,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "but we still go to private academies."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though we still go to the academies,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "we have a lot more free time"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "where we can spend more time doing things we like."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though it is vacation, my mother wants me to study more,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so every day she makes me study."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I like vacations because I have more freedom to do what I want"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "even though I have to study."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
